 type='text'>Thanks for publishing this piece, Will. I just don...</title><content type='html'>Thanks for publishing this piece, Will. I just donated to the Innocence Project. It&#39;s a small way to show that some people &lt;I&gt;do&lt;/I&gt; care about preventing these execrable &lt;I&gt;things&lt;/I&gt; that run the government from getting away with this bilge. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;If I may, I suggest everyone else do the same. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;-Sans Authoritas</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2464127347851891407/comments/default/658316610359328572'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2464127347851891407/comments/default/658316610359328572'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/05/this-is-man-heroic-intransigence-of.html?showComment=1210119720000#c658316610359328572' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/05/this-is-man-heroic-intransigence-of.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2464127347851891407' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2464127347851891407' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 6, 2008 at 6:22 PM"/></entry></feed>